flowchart TD
    prepare["1. Prepare today's tasks<br/>Leave out duplicates • sort by priority, then due time"]
    check{"2. For each task: does it fit<br/>your free time with no overlap?"}
    add["Add to plan<br/>Inside your free time"]
    skip["Skip it<br/>Note why"]
    show["3. Show the daily plan<br/>Banner + reasons for skipped tasks"]
    skipped{"Any skipped<br/>tasks?"}
    done["Done<br/>Plan is ready"]
    claude["4. Optional: ask Claude<br/>Explains the plan • suggests new times • care tips"]
    apply["5. Owner picks a time and clicks Apply<br/>Claude's time, an edited time, or their own"]

    prepare --> check
    check -->|Yes| add
    check -->|No| skip
    add --> show
    skip --> show
    show --> skipped
    skipped -->|No| done
    skipped -->|Yes| claude
    claude --> apply
    apply -->|Plan is rebuilt and re-checked| prepare
